{"id":"energi_a","lemma":"energía","pos":"noun","rank":715,"glosses":["energy"],"ipa":"/eneɾˈxia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"energías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-energ%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué despilfarro de energía!","en":"What a waste of energy!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519179"},{"text":"Los jóvenes por lo general están llenos de energías.","en":"Young people are usually full of energy."},{"text":"¡Qué gasto de energía!","en":"What a waste of energy!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519180"},{"text":"Cuidar del niño es un gran desgaste de sus energías.","en":"Taking care of the boy is a great drain on her energies."},{"text":"¡Qué derroche de energía!","en":"What a waste of energy!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519181"}]}